A6 Calibration set is unpoisoned and representative (Theorem 7.1). If poisoned, the coverage guarantee degrades by the adversarial fraction as bounded in Theorem 9.1.
A7 Tractable network structure (bounded treewidth) for exact inference (Theorem 14.1); otherwise the system must use approximate methods with conditional convergence.
